| projection rank 5 | 1.00 / 1.02 | 0.98 / 1.00 | 1.06 / 1.00 | 0.77 / 0.99 | 0.251 / 0.572 |
| projection rank 8 | 1.00 / 1.02 | 0.97 / 0.99 | 0.97 / 1.00 | 0.81 / 0.99 | 0.244 / 0.554 |
| projection rank 12 | 1.00 / 0.99 | 0.96 / 0.99 | 1.01 / 1.00 | 0.81 / 0.98 | 0.238 / 0.542 |
| NIK-tofts (trained) | 0.64 / 0.82 | 0.40 / 0.62 | 0.58 / 0.63 | 1.60 / 1.64 | |
| NIK-tofts8 (trained) | 0.76 / 0.96 | 0.44 / 0.66 | 0.60 / 0.68 | 1.31 / 1.46 | |
| NIK-patlak (trained) | 0.99 / 1.02 | 0.71 / 0.82 | 0.84 / 0.86 | 0.79 / 1.11 | |

